  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **All Time Low (2) (Widespread Panic)** (1 other source): Includes a brief tease of Born to Be Wild [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **You Don't Know My Mind (Jimmy Martin)**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Back Up and Push (traditional)**: back after 155 archived shows (1097 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **So Many Miles reprise**: back after 83 archived shows (376 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Love or Confusion (Jimi Hendrix)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-09-28.kreider** (recommended): audience recording; 28 songs; 165 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-09-28.kreider**: taped by Keith Kreider; transferred by Keith Kreider; source: AUD:SD [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK5 cardioid mics about seven feet high at the console cage's right front corner, into a Sound Devices MixPre-6 at 24-bit/96kHz [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Sacramento Memorial Auditorium - Sacramento, CA - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/sacramento-memorial-auditorium-sacramento-ca/) [4]",
